---
/**
 * Shipgirl Tracker
 * Converted from pages/shipgirl/shipgirl-tracker.html
 */
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Modal from '../../components/Modal.astro';
import '../../styles/rarity.css';
import '../../styles/shipgirl/shipgirl-tracker.core.css';
import '../../styles/shipgirl/shipgirl-tracker.filters.css';
import '../../styles/shipgirl/shipgirl-tracker.cards.css';
import '../../styles/shipgirl/shipgirl-tracker.scores.css';
import '../../styles/shipgirl/shipgirl-tracker.controls.css';
import '../../styles/shipgirl/shipgirl-tracker.responsive.css';
import '../../styles/shipgirl/shipgirl-tracker.goal.css';
import '../../styles/shipgirl/shipgirl-tracker.ledger.css';
import '../../styles/shipgirl/shipgirl-tracker.wall.css';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Layout title="함순이 육성트래커" {base}>
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <header class="st-page-header">
        <div class="header-title-container page-header-title">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">checklist</span>
            <h1>함순이 육성트래커</h1>
            <button class="info-button" id="info-button" title="사용법 보기">
                <i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i>
            </button>
        </div>
        <p class="st-page-sub">육성 현황과 함대 기술 점수를 한 곳에서 관리</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Info Popup -->
    <div id="info-popup" class="info-popup" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="popup-title" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="info-popup-content">
            <div class="popup-header">
                <h2 id="popup-title">초간단 설명서</h2>
                <button class="close-popup-btn" aria-label="닫기">
                    <i class="fas fa-times"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="popup-body">
                <div class="info-step">
                    <div class="info-icon"><i class="fas fa-check-square"></i></div>
                    <div class="info-content">
                        <h3>보유 체크</h3>
                        <p>상단 <strong>보기 전환</strong>을 누를 때마다 <strong>목록형 → 카드형 → 요약형</strong> 순으로 바뀝니다. 보유·풀돌·Lv120 체크박스를 누르면 기술/진영 점수에 반영되고, 육성 레벨(성정 유닛)·개장·호감작·스작 같은 육성 기록도 함께 남길 수 있습니다.</p>
                        <p><strong>요약형 보기</strong>는 모든 함순이를 작은 타일로 한눈에 봅니다. <strong>지표</strong>를 육성 레벨 / 스작 / 호감작 중에서 고르면 타일 아래 막대가 그 지표의 진행도를 나타내고, 타일을 <strong>누르면 한 단계 위</strong>로 올라갑니다. <strong>Shift+클릭</strong>·<strong>우클릭</strong>(모바일은 <strong>길게 누르기</strong>)은 한 단계 내립니다. 미획득 함순이는 어떤 지표에서든 흑백으로 표시됩니다. 정렬은 지표를 바꿀 때와 <strong>재정렬</strong>을 누를 때만 다시 계산되므로, 연속으로 표시하는 동안 타일이 움직이지 않습니다.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-step">
                    <div class="info-icon"><i class="fas fa-heart"></i></div>
                    <div class="info-content">
                        <h3>육성 기록</h3>
                        <p><strong>호감작</strong>과 <strong>스작</strong> 버튼을 누르면 전체 단계 메뉴가 열려 원하는 상태를 바로 선택할 수 있습니다. <strong>육성 레벨</strong> 바의 <strong>120 / 125</strong>는 각각 토글입니다. 125를 켜면 120도 함께 켜지고, 120을 끄면 125도 함께 꺼집니다. Lv120 달성 체크와도 서로 연동됩니다.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-step">
                    <div class="info-icon"><i class="fas fa-filter"></i></div>
                    <div class="info-content">
                        <h3>필터</h3>
                        <p>상단 툴바의 <strong>필터</strong> 버튼으로 등급, 진영, 함종 등 다양한 조건으로 필터링할 수 있습니다.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-step">
                    <div class="info-icon"><i class="fas fa-chart-bar"></i></div>
                    <div class="info-content">
                        <h3>점수판 & 목표</h3>
                        <p><strong>점수판</strong>에서 현재 기술/진영 점수를 확인하고, <strong>목표</strong>에서 달성 현황을 추적할 수 있습니다.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="st-sticky-sentinel" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="st-control-surface" id="control-surface">
        <!-- Toolbar -->
        <div class="st-toolbar">
            <div class="st-toolbar-left">
                <div class="st-search-wrapper">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined st-search-icon">search</span>
                    <input type="text" id="search-bar" class="st-search-input" placeholder="이름으로 검색..." autocomplete="off">
                    <div class="dropdown-content" id="search-dropdown"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="st-toolbar-right">
                <!-- Initial state matches the cards default in shipgirl-tracker.js -->
                <button class="st-toolbar-btn" id="view-toggle-btn" aria-label="보기 전환">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined" id="view-toggle-icon">view_list</span>
                    <span id="view-toggle-label">목록형 보기</span>
                </button>
                <button class="st-toolbar-btn" id="filter-drawer-btn">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">tune</span>
                    <span>필터</span>
                    <span class="badge badge--count hidden" id="filter-badge">0</span>
                </button>
                <button class="st-toolbar-btn" id="score-modal-btn">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">leaderboard</span>
                    <span>점수판</span>
                </button>
                <button class="st-toolbar-btn" id="goal-modal-btn">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">flag</span>
                    <span>연구 목표</span>
                </button>
                <button class="st-toolbar-btn" id="sheet-import-btn">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">table_view</span>
                    <span>시트 가져오기</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Score / investment summary strip -->
        <div class="st-summary" id="tracker-summary">
            <div class="st-sum-item" title="현재 기술 Pt / 최대 기술 Pt">
                <span class="st-sum-label">기술 Pt</span>
                <span class="st-sum-value"><b id="total-score-value">0</b> <small>/ <span id="total-score-max">0</span></small></span>
            </div>
            <div class="st-sum-item" title="보유 함순이 / 전체 함순이">
                <span class="st-sum-label">보유 함순이</span>
                <span class="st-sum-value"><b id="owned-count">0</b> <small>/ <span id="owned-total">0</span><span id="owned-pct"></span></small></span>
            </div>
            <div class="st-sum-item" title="Lv100→120 육성에 쓴 성정 유닛 / 전체 함순이 기준 필요량">
                <span class="st-sum-label">성정 유닛 I <small>(Lv100→120)</small></span>
                <span class="st-sum-value"><b id="unit1-120-invested">0</b> <small>/ <span id="unit1-120-total">0</span></small></span>
            </div>
            <div class="st-sum-item" title="Lv120→125 돌파에 쓴 성정 유닛 / 전체 함순이 기준 필요량">
                <span class="st-sum-label">성정 유닛 I <small>(Lv120→125)</small></span>
                <span class="st-sum-value"><b id="unit1-125-invested">0</b> <small>/ <span id="unit1-125-total">0</span></small></span>
            </div>
            <div class="st-sum-item" title="Lv120→125 돌파에 쓴 성정 유닛II / 전체 함순이 기준 필요량">
                <span class="st-sum-label">성정 유닛 II <small>(Lv120→125)</small></span>
                <span class="st-sum-value"><b id="unit2-125-invested">0</b> <small>/ <span id="unit2-125-total">0</span></small></span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Active filter chips -->
        <div class="st-chips-row" id="filter-chips"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- 요약 wall 지표 selector. Deliberately OUTSIDE .st-control-surface: a row
         inside that sticky panel pushes its bottom edge down over the summary
         strip. It belongs with the grid it drives, exactly like #ledger-head.
         Visibility is owned by showElement/hideElement only (see applyView) —
         never set inline display on this element. -->
    <div class="st-wall-metrics hidden" id="wall-metric-row">
        <span class="st-wall-metrics-label">지표</span>
        <div class="btn-group" id="wall-metric-group" role="group" aria-label="요약 지표 선택">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm is-active" data-metric="lv" aria-pressed="true">육성 레벨</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" data-metric="skl" aria-pressed="false">스작</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" data-metric="aff" aria-pressed="false">호감작</button>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" id="wall-sort-btn">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">swap_vert</span>
            <span>높은 순으로 재정렬</span>
        </button>
        <span class="st-wall-hint st-wall-hint--pointer">타일을 누르면 한 단계 올라가고, Shift+클릭·우클릭은 내려갑니다</span>
        <span class="st-wall-hint st-wall-hint--touch">타일을 누르면 한 단계 올라가고, 길게 누르면 내려갑니다</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Ship list. Cards is the default view, so the ledger head starts hidden —
         its visibility is owned by inline style.display only (see applyView). -->
    <div id="ledger-head" aria-hidden="true" style="display:none">
        <div></div><div class="lh-name">함순이</div><div>보유</div><div>풀돌</div><div>Lv120</div>
        <div>기술 Pt</div><div>육성 레벨</div><div>기타 육성</div><div>메모</div>
    </div>
    <div id="ship-list-container" class="card-grid" data-view="cards"></div>
    <div id="tracker-empty" class="hidden" aria-live="polite"></div>

    <!-- Filter Drawer (right side) -->
    <div class="st-drawer-backdrop drawer-backdrop" id="filter-drawer-backdrop"></div>
    <aside class="st-drawer drawer" id="filter-drawer">
        <div class="st-drawer-header">
            <h2>필터 <span class="st-drawer-count" id="drawer-count"></span></h2>
            <div class="st-drawer-head-actions">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" id="reset-filters-btn">초기화</button>
                <button class="st-drawer-close" aria-label="닫기">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">close</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="st-drawer-body scroll-styled" id="filter-drawer-body">
            <!-- Filter controls rendered by JS -->
        </div>
    </aside>

    <!-- Score Modal -->
    <div class="st-modal hidden" id="score-modal">
        <div class="st-modal-content st-modal-lg scroll-styled">
            <div class="st-modal-header">
                <h2>점수 현황</h2>
                <button class="st-modal-close modal-close" aria-label="닫기">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">close</span>
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="st-modal-body" id="score-modal-body">
                <div id="fleet-tech-container"></div>
                <div id="stat-tech-container"></div>
                <div id="faction-tech-container"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Goal Modal -->
    <div class="st-modal hidden" id="goal-modal">
        <div class="st-modal-content st-modal-md scroll-styled">
            <div class="st-modal-header">
                <h2>목표 달성 현황</h2>
                <button class="st-modal-close modal-close" aria-label="닫기">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">close</span>
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="st-modal-body" id="goal-modal-body">
                <!-- Goal tracker rendered by JS -->
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Confirmation Modal -->
    <div class="st-modal hidden" id="confirmation-modal">
        <div class="st-modal-content st-modal-sm scroll-styled">
            <div class="st-modal-header">
                <h2>확인</h2>
                <button class="st-modal-close modal-close" aria-label="닫기">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">close</span>
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="st-modal-body">
                <p id="modal-text" class="confirm-message"></p>
                <div class="modal-actions">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="modal-confirm-btn">당장 진행시켜</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" id="modal-cancel-btn">잘못 눌렀어요</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <Modal id="memo-modal" maxWidth="26rem">
        <h2 class="c-modal-title" id="memo-modal-ship"></h2>
        <textarea id="memo-input" class="scroll-styled" rows="5" maxlength="500"
                  placeholder="자유 코멘트 (입수처, 육성 계획 등)"></textarea>
        <div class="modal-actions" slot="footer">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="memo-save-btn">저장</button>
        </div>
    </Modal>

    <Modal id="sheet-modal" title="시트에서 가져오기" maxWidth="44rem">
        <ol class="sheet-howto">
            <li>구글 시트에서 머리글 행을 포함해 원하는 범위를 복사합니다.</li>
            <li>아래 칸에 붙여넣거나, 내려받은 CSV 파일을 선택합니다.</li>
            <li>미리보기에서 인식된 함순이 수를 확인한 뒤 적용합니다.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="sheet-note">
            <strong>ID</strong> 열을 기준으로 맞춥니다(<code>123</code> · <code>Z001</code> ·
            <code>P001</code> · <code>M061</code>). 이름은 확인용으로만 쓰며, 빈 칸은
            <strong>변경하지 않음</strong>으로 처리합니다. 점수·능력치 등 계산용 열은 무시합니다.
        </p>

        <label class="sheet-field">
            <span class="sheet-field-label">CSV 파일</span>
            <input type="file" id="sheet-file" accept=".csv,.tsv,.txt,text/csv,text/tab-separated-values">
        </label>

        <label class="sheet-field">
            <span class="sheet-field-label">또는 시트에서 복사해 붙여넣기</span>
            <textarea id="sheet-paste" class="scroll-styled" rows="6" spellcheck="false"
                      placeholder="ID&#9;사진&#9;이름&#9;…"></textarea>
        </label>

        <p class="sheet-status" id="sheet-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <div class="sheet-preview scroll-styled" id="sheet-preview"></div>

        <div class="modal-actions" slot="footer">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="sheet-apply-btn" disabled>적용</button>
        </div>
    </Modal>

    <script is:inline type="module" src={`${base}/js/shipgirl/shipgirl-tracker-utils.js`}></script>
    <script is:inline type="module" src={`${base}/js/shipgirl/shipgirl-tracker.js`}></script>
</Layout>
